{"title": "Call Lightning (Condition)", "pageid": 22187, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Call_Lightning_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Call_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Call_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Call_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Call_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Call_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Call_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Call Lightning Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Call_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Call_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Call_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Call Lightning</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Activate_Call_Lightning\" title=\"Activate Call Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/38px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/50px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Call Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Activate_Call_Lightning\" title=\"Activate Call Lightning\">Call Lightning</a> without expending a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CALL_LIGHTNING_SPELL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCALL_LIGHTNING_SPELL%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCALL_LIGHTNING_SPELL%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Activate_Call_Lightning\" title=\"Activate Call Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/60px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/80px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Activate Call Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Activate_Call_Lightning\" title=\"Activate Call Lightning\">Activate Call Lightning</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Call down more lightning to hit all targets within the area of effect. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This version of the spell will match the level of the initial cast. For example, if the initial cast is upcast to 6th level to deal 6d10, all subsequent recasts will also deal 6d10.</li>\n<li>When multiclassing, these recasts use the spellcasting modifier of the most recent new class rather than the spellcasting modifier that was used for the initial cast of Call Lightning. This may result in an unexpectedly low spell save DC.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Call_Lightning\">Sources of Call Lightning</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Call_Lightning\" title=\"Call Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/30px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/45px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/60px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Call Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/30px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Call_Lightning\" title=\"Call Lightning\">Call Lightning</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203252\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1647/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22677/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6797/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1280788/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.108      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   54.108      1 -total\n 53.11%   28.738      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.99%   13.519      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 14.07%    7.61